5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need a sustainable system for the year. Let's start by identifying the actual workload and costs.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A rational approach is best. I suspect our current perception of ""fairness"" might be slightly skewed from reality.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want to stop guessing if the bathroom is scary today! Let's find out why it gets so messy!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely if we could all feel comfortable. I'm a bit worried about how we handle the supplies.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us look at the facts, but remember that harmony is more valuable than a spotless floor.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. I'll look into the actual time it takes to clean and the professional options.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, a good start. I'm more interested in the correlation between usage and the current labor distribution.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Ooh! I want to see the secret notes from the people who lived here before! Maybe they had a magic trick!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be helpful to see the receipts for the sprays and the management office rates.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall observe the patterns of our daily lives and what we each consider to be ""finished.""","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
