16,1,3,pass,Benjamin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm also going to check the bathroom grout! I bet there are mysteries hiding in there!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, you are always so energetic. It makes me smile.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Energy is the spark of life, Shizue. It is a gift we should all cherish.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
