35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The time required is higher than we've discussed. A full pass takes over an hour and a half.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Fascinating. It seems our ""equal"" distribution is quite an illusion when one considers who is actually present.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Guess what! The previous people stopped talking to each other! We can't let that happen, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear. It seems we've been spending quite a bit on supplies, and the billing is a bit confusing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is a delicate dance. We must ensure that no one feels burdened while others simply drift by.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if the time is the issue, we should consider if a professional firm is viable, though they require prep work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, logic suggests that if usage is skewed, the labor should be too. Why should a ghost pay in sweat?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Also, the bathroom grout gets icky really fast! Even after a big scrub, it's back in like, ten days!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,I worry that some of us are paying more than others for the sponges and bags without realizing it.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,Let us be careful. To count every penny or every minute can sometimes cost us our friendship.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,Friendship is easier to maintain when no one is resentful about their free time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. A system based on actual presence and usage is the only way to avoid that resentment.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I just want it to be clean every day! No more scary bathrooms!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps a simple shared fund for supplies would make everyone feel more at ease?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A shared fund is a gesture of trust. Trust is the foundation of any home.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,We have enough information to weigh our options now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. I believe we can now construct a model that is both fair and sustainable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Let's pick the one that makes the house happy!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope we can find a way that is kind to everyone's wallet and heart.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Whatever we choose, let us promise to speak our truths with love before they become burdens.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
