60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option B removes the time burden entirely, though it adds a financial cost and requires prep.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option A is the traditional choice, but it ignores the reality of who is actually using the space.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like Option C! If one person is bad at it, the room stays scary forever!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B would be very tidy, but I wonder if we can manage the payments fairly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A provides a rhythm, but Option B provides peace. Peace is a wonderful thing to buy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, you're right about C. Option B is the most consistent for the house's condition.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While B is efficient, it doesn't solve the usage disparity. However, it is the most objective solution.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,I love Option B! A professional cleaner is like a superhero for the bathroom!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we go with B, can we please set up a clear monthly fund for both the cleaner and the supplies?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,A shared fund for the cleaner and the soap would be a beautiful way to unify our efforts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,I support that. It removes the hidden hours of labor that often lead to burnout.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I can agree to B, provided the cost is split logically. It is better than a flawed rota.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Me too! Me too! No more guessing if the kitchen is grim!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel much better knowing we can organize the costs properly. I vote for B.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"When we remove the source of friction, we leave room for kindness. I am in favor of B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,It seems we are in agreement.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,A rare moment of total consensus. How refreshing.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Superhero cleaners!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we could talk this through so gently.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"This is the true victory. Not the clean room, but the shared smile.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
